          "ink": "blue"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Payload on the heap, one-word pointer on the stack",
            "`Box::new(5)` allocates; `*b` reads it back",
            "Freed automatically at end of scope",
            "`size_of::<Box<T>>()` is one usize — 8 bytes, same as `&T`"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "rust",
          "lines": [
            "let b = Box::new(5);     // heap alloc",
            "println!(\"{}\", *b);      // deref read",
            "let v = *b;              // move out, legal",
            "// allocation freed at scope end"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Use 1 — Recursive Types"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
