        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Implement `fn deref(&self) -> &Self::Target`",
            "The compiler rewrites `*b` into `*(b.deref())`",
            "`DerefMut` supplies the mutable path",
            "`DerefMut` requires `Deref` as a supertrait"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "rust",
          "lines": [
            "impl<T> Deref for MyBox<T> {",
            "    type Target = T;",
            "    fn deref(&self) -> &T { &self.0 }",
            "}"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Deref Coercion"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "`&Box<String>` becomes `&String`, then `&str`",
            "Chains until the types match",
            "`hello(&boxed_name)` compiles for `fn hello(name: &str)`",
            "Runs at compile time — zero runtime cost",
            "Does not fire for generic type parameters"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "diagram",
          "kind": "flow",
          "spec": {
